      "uid": "zhcn:0d14eb9776f66ed9e5c5ce9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够彼此砥砺的同期伙伴，\n还有最重要的――西沙里奥那无论听多少遍\n都令人屏息的宏大梦想……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e80d9e323d50576c6b531a322cb0abf41ca37471fc36aab2873b103804bdffd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:134c68d07d4ebe32a85327fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎能不赞叹呢！\n……这样的感慨\n并非只有此刻才有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4601816c50ef59ba6fc05b0e1afa14e1a490b454af0e8f51ac6fd92839be1aa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50675c5d71dc8d0009cc5f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在训练开始时\n的会议中也是如此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a62a33425e8c14db26100ad25e5dc31b307af5be53d3a4f7f4658a3f56077c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
