    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab142c6956d9b7327718c810",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先我想使用时间线工具\n把达成目标所需的任务，里程碑，\n期限全部可视化――",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7f2a812eb832afafc6fa1dfa542722e42557a41faad8026fd0b88f1d090dd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
