      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/83/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd128bf1e9fd2303542099b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双腿柔韧有力地蹬向地面，\n如暴风般疾驰。一路向前，仿佛永无止境――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d72f8dcc6fa0eb737706febc70d800d8d06cb4b9808baf2341e560204307b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de88bc45455767d7be5747cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强韧的心肺功能，柔软的关节。\n凭借令人不由得看入迷的压倒性才能――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50ccc013f044124229b676bb45103dca381d7b6dc1d94f22da6523c8845f48a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d32ecbce9a4ec04b01ef9e18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太棒了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3398bf8aa9752003232f3ff763f430740b6fbe987e7e63d55098ca545767bcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
